for coronavirus.

00:06:42.067 --> 00:06:45.638 line:0%
In all, 14 people in the
clubhouse have tested positive.

00:06:45.638 --> 00:06:48.908
-14 players and coaches
on one team

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:52.110
